WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
I think technology in and of itself, you cannot say it's good or bad.

00:04.000 --> 00:08.000
I think you have to look at technology neutrally.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.000
I think what we do with technology, you can jump in now.

00:12.000 --> 00:14.000
It's a grease.

00:14.000 --> 00:16.000
I'm so sorry.

00:16.000 --> 00:19.000
But technology is never neutral because it's not God-given.

00:19.000 --> 00:20.000
We designed it.

00:20.000 --> 00:22.000
And we designed it to do something.

00:22.000 --> 00:23.000
I agree.

00:23.000 --> 00:26.000
So for example, it would never occur to you to cook with a gun.

00:26.000 --> 00:27.000
It's not made for land.

00:27.000 --> 00:29.000
It's made to threaten or kill.

00:29.000 --> 00:32.000
And there might be a function in that, but it's not neutral.

00:32.000 --> 00:36.000
And when you design AI to extract all value,

00:36.000 --> 00:40.000
without consent, to surveil on a mass scale, that is not neutral.

00:40.000 --> 00:42.000
And every surveillance tool is not neutral.

00:42.000 --> 00:45.000
Surveillance is made to control.

00:45.000 --> 00:46.000
And we're social beings.

00:46.000 --> 00:47.000
So what do we control?

00:47.000 --> 00:49.000
We control other human beings.

00:49.000 --> 00:50.000
I agree.

